From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hideoutgames <154709155+hideoutgames@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 21:20:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] edge: APNs alert banners when a session finishes

Register kind=alert device tokens on the existing /live-activity route
and send apns-push-type:alert when sessions.status returns to idle after
working/awaitingInput (or flips to errored). Reuses the Live Activity
APNs JWT. Inert without APNS_* secrets.
---
